on, known professionally as Yesung, is a South Korean singer, songwriter, actor, radio personality, and television presenter. He debuted in 2005 as a member of Super Junior and its subgroups Super Junior-K.R.Y. (2006), Super Junior-H (2008) and participated in SM Entertainment's projects SM The Ballad (2014). Aside from group activities, he has recorded songs for various television dramas and movies, participated in various television dramas, movies, musicals and radio hosting. He began his solo career in 2016 with his first extended play, Here I Am.","title":"Yesung","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yesung"}},"Q483926":{"id":"Q483926","name":"Kim Hyung-jun","ko":"김형준","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kim Hyeong-jun"],"birth":"1987-08-03","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["actor","singer","model","television actor","rapper","disc jockey"],"debut":"2005","agencies":[{"name":"Pony Canyon","id":"Q513712","start":"","end":""},{"name":"DSP Media","id":"Q489428","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q489849","name":"SS501","start":"","end":""},{"id":"Q22971816","name":"Double S 301","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kimhyungjun87/","x":"https://x.com/HyungJun87","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/e9bfcdd6-14a4-43b3-8033-b7ca51820591"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a2/161208_%EA%B9%80%ED%98%95%EC%A4%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:161208_%EA%B9%80%ED%98%95%EC%A4%80.jpg","author":"tenasia10","license":"CC BY 3.0"},"bio":{"text":"Kim Hyung-jun is a South Korean entertainer, lead rapper and youngest member of boyband SS501 and SS301. In 2010, Kim left DSP Media, who managed him as part of SS501, and joined S-Plus Entertainment as a solo artist. He made his debut as a soloist in March 2011 with mini album My Girl, and musical debut in Caffeine. In 2012, Kim starred on his first main lead role as Kang-min in KBS Drama's My Shining Girl, followed by SBS Plus's Late Blossom as Jung Min-chae in the same year. At the end of the year, Kim received the Rising Star Award for his role in Late Blossom by the K-Drama Star Awards.","title":"Kim Hyung-jun","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Hyung-jun"}},"Q484886":{"id":"Q484886","name":"Park So-yeon","ko":"소연","birthName":"박인정","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Soyeon","Park In-jeong"],"birth":"1987-10-05","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor","model"],"debut":"2009","agencies":[{"name":"MBK Entertainment","id":"Q429296","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q495383","name":"T-ara","start":"2009","end":"2017"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/melodysoyani/","x":"https://x.com/sohotmelody","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/8187583f-e083-4e87-98a8-d1ab1c52f5e0"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Park So-yeon, referred to as Soyeon, is a South Korean singer and actress. She debuted as a member of girl group T-ara in July 2009. The group went on to become one of the best-selling girl groups of all time.","title":"Park So-yeon (singer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Park_So-yeon_%28singer%29"}},"Q493526":{"id":"Q493526","name":"Yong Jun-hyung","ko":"용준형","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Yong Jun-hyeong"],"birth":"1989-12-19","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["actor","record producer","songwriter","singer","rapper","singer-songwriter"],"debut":"2007","agencies":[{"name":"Cube Entertainment","id":"Q484449","start":"","end":""},{"name":"Around Us Entertainment","id":"Q28048734","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q25537387","name":"XING (band)","start":"2007","end":"2008"},{"id":"Q269595","name":"Highlight","start":"2009","end":"2019"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/bigbadboii/","x":"https://x.com/joker891219","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/441159a8-b78f-48c8-8ac7-4435e236c23c"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Yong Jun-hyung, known mononymously as Junhyung, is a South Korean singer-songwriter, record producer and actor. He rose to fame as a member of South Korean boy band Highlight (formerly known as Beast), formed in 2009. He departed from Highlight in 2019, amidst a controversy where he admitted to having watched a video of singer Jung Joon-young making out with a woman, which was filmed with consent but shared without. As a solo artist, he released one extended play, Flower (2013), and one full-length album, Goodbye 20's (2018). He also starred in the Korean dramas Monstar (2013) and Coffee, Do Me a Favor (2018).","title":"Yong Jun-hyung","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yong_Jun-hyung"}},"Q493590":{"id":"Q493590","name":"Shin Dongho","ko":"신동호","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Shin Dong-ho"],"birth":"1994-06-29","death":"","birthplace":"Yeouido","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor"],"debut":"2008","agencies":[{"name":"NH Media","id":"Q16465976","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q482543","name":"U-KISS","start":"2008","end":"2013"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/dj_rushin_justin/","x":"https://x.com/dongho94","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/617d9760-735f-4065-95f0-ca554b95ea15"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Shin Dong-ho is a former South Korean singer who acquired fame as a singer of the boy group U-KISS. Dongho was the most active member of the group, appearing in a great many reality shows and other productions. He joined U-KISS in 2008 and stayed with them for five years.","title":"Shin Dong-ho","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shin_Dong-ho"}},"Q5208214":{"id":"Q5208214","name":"Jung Dae-hyun","ko":"정대현","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Daehyun","Jeong Daehyeon"],"birth":"1993-06-28","death":"","birthp